{
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 10: The Fall of Saigon",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s11b01",
     "shot": "offensive75",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "In early 1975, North Vietnam launched a major offensive against South Vietnam.",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       4,
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "date": 1975
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b02",
     "shot": "collapse",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The initial attacks were intended to test the strength of the South Vietnamese military.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b03",
     "shot": "collapse",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Instead, they revealed just how fragile it had become.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "crack",
       "w:fragile",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b04",
     "shot": "offensive75",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "South Vietnamese forces retreated from key positions.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b05",
     "shot": "collapse",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Confused orders, collapsing morale, and the rapid loss of territory turned a military crisis",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b06",
     "shot": "collapse",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "into a national disaster.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:national",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b07",
     "shot": "offensive75",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Cities fell in quick succession.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       4,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:succession.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b08",
     "shot": "offensive75",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The North Vietnamese leadership realized that victory might come much sooner than expected.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b09",
     "shot": "offensive75",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The offensive accelerated toward Saigon.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       4,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b10",
     "shot": "thieu",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And the South Vietnamese government was running out of time.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b11",
     "shot": "thieu",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "President Nguyen Van Thieu resigned on April 21, 1975, and left the country.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "steps",
       "w:resigned",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b12",
     "shot": "closing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "By late April, North Vietnamese forces were closing in on the capital.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b13",
     "shot": "closing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "American officials began preparing the final evacuation.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": []
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b14",
     "shot": "closing",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The operation became known as Frequent Wind.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop2",
       "w:Frequent",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b15",
     "shot": "airport",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On April 29, North Vietnamese shelling struck Tan Son Nhut Airport,",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boom",
       "w:shelling",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b16",
     "shot": "airport",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "killing two American Marines, Charles McMahon and Darwin Judge.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b17",
     "shot": "airport",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "They were the last American servicemen killed in combat in Vietnam.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "quiet": true,
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b18",
     "shot": "airport",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "With the airport under fire, large-scale evacuation by fixed-wing aircraft was no longer possible.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:no",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b19",
     "shot": "gather",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Helicopters became the only practical way to remove the remaining Americans and many Vietnamese",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind",
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b20",
     "shot": "gather",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "civilians who had worked with the United States.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind",
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b21",
     "shot": "gather",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Thousands gathered at evacuation points.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind",
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b22",
     "shot": "gather",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Some had served alongside American forces.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind",
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b23",
     "shot": "gather",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Others had worked for American agencies or feared retaliation from the incoming government.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind",
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b24",
     "shot": "gather",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "They knew what might happen if they were left behind.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind",
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b25",
     "shot": "gather",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And there was not enough space for everyone.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind",
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b26",
     "shot": "lift",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "During the evacuation, helicopters carried people from rooftops and other locations to American ships waiting offshore.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b27",
     "shot": "ship_deck",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Pilots flew repeated missions under immense pressure.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b28",
     "shot": "ship_deck",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On the ships, crews cleared deck space for incoming helicopters.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b29",
     "shot": "ship_deck",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Some South Vietnamese aircraft were pushed overboard to make room for more evacuees.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:pushed",
       0.5
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b30",
     "shot": "tally",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The operation moved more than 7,000 people by helicopter in roughly 19 hours.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       "w:7,000",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "amb": "waves"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b31",
     "shot": "tally",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But many Vietnamese who wanted to escape could not get out.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "amb": "waves",
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b32",
     "shot": "palace_gate",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Then came the morning of April 30, 1975.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       4,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b33",
     "shot": "palace_gate",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "North Vietnamese tanks entered Saigon.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "machine",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b34",
     "shot": "palace_gate",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "One of them crashed through the gates of the presidential palace.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "machine",
       0,
       0.4
      ],
      [
       "slam",
       "w:crashed",
       0.9
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b35",
     "shot": "palace_gate",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The South Vietnamese government surrendered.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "stamp",
       "w:surrendered.",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b36",
     "shot": "over",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "After nearly two decades of escalating American involvement, the war was over.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b37",
     "shot": "over",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Saigon would later be renamed Ho Chi Minh City,",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:Ho",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b38",
     "shot": "over",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "after the revolutionary leader who had declared Vietnam independent 30 years earlier.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b39",
     "shot": "over",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But Ho Chi Minh himself never witnessed the victory.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b40",
     "shot": "over",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "He had died in 1969.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b41",
     "shot": "over",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The country he had fought to unite was now under communist rule.",
     "date": 1975,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b42",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the United States had failed to achieve the central objective for which it",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b43",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "had committed so much blood and treasure.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b44",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The most powerful military in the world had withdrawn.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b45",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The government it had spent years supporting had collapsed.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b46",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And the images of the final evacuation became the defining pictures of America's defeat in Vietnam.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b47",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But the fall of Saigon was only the end of the story on the battlefield.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [],
     "mood": "sombre"
    },
    {
     "id": "s11b48",
     "shot": "verdict",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The consequences would continue for decades.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:decades.",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "mood": "sombre"
    }
   ],
   "mood": "tension"
  }
 ]
}